{
  "chapter": 9,
  "title": "Sailor Venus Victory",
  "scriptId": "ch0999",
  "endReturnScreen": "selector",
  "entries": [
    {
      "speaker": "Sailor Venus",
      "text": "My, my. You are actually quite lovely.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/deadline/sailorvenus_story.png",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "assets/combat/bgm/sailorVenusStory.wav",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "\"Actually\" is such a backhanded compliment.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "Take the win, diva.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Sailor Venus",
      "text": "You have charm, but charm alone is lazy. Beauty on stage is an active choice.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Meaning?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Sailor Venus",
      "text": "Meaning elegance. Grace. The discipline to make every gesture look effortless even when your heart is racing.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "So being lovely is work too.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Sailor Venus",
      "text": "Of course. Fans fall in love with what you make them feel.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Sailor Venus",
      "text": "If you wish to capture hearts, then shine on purpose. Love them back with every step you take.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "...I think I understand.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Sailor Venus",
      "text": "Good. Stay lovely, stay brave, and never walk onto a stage looking like you have already surrendered.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    }
  ]
}
